- Local elevation models.
- Landing site inspection mode.

IMPORTANT:
Do not claim that every HiRISE image has a corresponding Digital Terrain Model. Use actual available stereo products.

Do not use image resolution alone to claim that a rock has been automatically detected. Distinguish image interpretation from verified hazard detection.

