15. SCIENTIFIC DATA CLASSIFICATION
==================================================

Every displayed data point must belong to one of these categories:

A. MEASURED

Directly obtained from a scientific instrument or validated archived observation.

B. DERIVED

Calculated from measured or archived data using a documented processing method.

C. MODELLED

Produced by a scientific model or estimation process.

D. SIMULATED

Generated by the game's educational mission simulation.

E. UNAVAILABLE

Required data is not available or could not be retrieved.

Display the classification clearly in the interface.

Each scientific observation should retain:

- Dataset ID.
- Instrument.
- Source mission.
- Observation location.
- Observation time.
- Units.
- Original product identifier, when available.
- Processing method.
- Data classification.
- Source citation.

Never mix these categories without clear labels.

